{"schemaVersion":1,"moduleId":"M2-02","example":{"title":"圓環管制","intro":"把環內優先、入口減速與環內導引，用一組一致的設施表達。","items":[{"id":"priority","title":"明確提示環內優先","text":"以讓路標誌及讓路線提示進環車輛讓行，減少環內、環外車輛爭道。"},{"id":"entry","title":"入口線型引導減速與偏移","text":"分隔島、槽化與標線配合行車軌跡，讓駕駛提前辨識入口及偏移方向。"},{"id":"continuity","title":"維持環內至出口的導引連續","text":"串接環內車道與出口路徑，減少臨時換道、切入出口或不必要的減速。"},{"id":"walking","title":"一起安排入口與出口的行人穿越","text":"檢視行穿線、庇護空間與讓路位置，避免車流停等遮擋行人。"}],"moduleId":"M2-02","pageId":"results-module-m2-02","images":[{"key":"results:module-m2-02-current-1","role":"current","label":"現況問題","rotation":0},{"key":"results:module-m2-02-diagram","role":"module","label":"模組圖","rotation":0}],"source":{"file":"chapters/03-modules/05-roundabout-control.typ","sha256":"e34fe91f478cb7c73edea27512d9c64b05d22abadd5f61e121a6b0a9baf0dac4","title":"圓環管制","moduleId":"M2-02","section":"現況與議題、圖例說明及延伸應用","issuePageId":"m202-roundabout-issues","diagramPageId":"m202-roundabout-diagram","representative":"materials/03-modules/M2-02/M2-02_圓環管制路口模組代表型.svg"}},"assets":{"results:module-m2-02-current-1":{"file":"materials/03-modules/M2-02/M2-02.1_現況議題_01.png","width":1737,"height":941,"moduleId":"M2-02","role":"current","label":"M2-02 現況問題 1","sha256":"4790a428c287c14ab49bcc849304cb588b5518554dea5d9d43344efe1a625e7c"},"results:module-m2-02-diagram":{"file":"materials/03-modules/M2-02/M2-02_圓環管制路口模組代表型.svg","width":684,"height":773,"moduleId":"M2-02","role":"module","label":"M2-02 模組圖","sha256":"d49b31c1cda3452cbce76b6a00e62e046c9f303e1b882129c291c226d7b69f16"}}}
